},"children":["境外自驾先确认当地认不认中国驾照，网上卖的「国际驾照」多数是废纸"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["网上代办的「国际驾照」在中国内地不成立。那本证是 1949 年日内瓦公约缔约方之间互认的翻译件，103 个缔约方里没有中国内地。所以国内不管谁给你办，都没有法律…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/21-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["找中介办签证、留学、移民，先问它有没有在移民管理机构备案"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["2026 年 9 月 15 日起，办签证、留学、移民的中介要向移民管理机构备案。夸大宣传招揽客人，提供或者协助提供虚假材料，都是明令禁止的。听到「包过」「保签」…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/21"},"children":["阅读整个主题：出国、旅行与境外安全 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria